      <title>NFL Announces Each Quarter Of Playoff Game Will Be Broadcast On Different Streaming Service</title>
      <link>https://babylonbee.com/news/nfl-announces-each-quarter-of-playoff-game-will-be-broadcast-on-a-different-network/</link>
      <description>U.S. — In its ongoing effort to make watching football as difficult as possible, the National Football League announced today that each quarter of the playoff games will be exclusively streamed on a different streaming network.</description>
